1. DeepFilterNet3 and DeepFilterNet3-LL
   Hendrik Schröter, Tobias Rosenkranz, Alberto N. Escalante-B., Andreas Maier.
   https://github.com/Rikorose/DeepFilterNet
   License: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (deepfilternet3/LICENSE-DeepFilterNet-MIT).
   Files: deepfilternet3/dfn3-ladspa/dfn3_weights.bin,
          deepfilternet3/dfn3ll-ladspa/dfn3ll_weights.bin
   Changes: GRU projection matrices quantized to int8 with per-row scales
   (deepfilternet3/scripts/quantize_int8.py); other tensors kept in f32 and
   repacked into the layout the engines load.

2. DPDFNet-2 48 kHz HR
   Daniel Rika, Nino Sapir, Ido Gus (Ceva). https://github.com/ceva-ip/DPDFNet
   License: Apache-2.0 (dpdfnet/model/LICENSE).
   Source code commit 9bd9844a227bb6aa57e55588d8d0e961fcff1c46.
   Checkpoint dpdfnet2_48khz_hr.pth from https://huggingface.co/Ceva-IP/DPDFNet,
   revision dd6818d00f50c836fed43a6243ebe49116de5964,
   sha256 f4eb984dc80d66d6e417a8d6ad8855b4fd0b559452db1e68950f028234109d5c.
   Files: dpdfnet/model/dpdfnet2_48khz_hr-w8a16/
   Changes: batch norm folded into the convolutions, GRU matrices quantized to
   int8 with per-row scales and reordered to z,r,n gates
   (dpdfnet/tools/export_model.py), then repacked losslessly
   (dpdfnet/tools/pack_matrices.py).

3. GTCRN-AEC (LocalVQE)
   localai-org. https://github.com/localai-org/LocalVQE
   License: Apache-2.0 (gtcrn-aec/model/LICENSE).
   File: gtcrn-aec/model/localvqe-pi-aec-v1-49k-f32.gguf, unmodified, from
   https://huggingface.co/LocalAI-io/LocalVQE,
   sha256 b80b75b9038d0d28079a84afe7d4f0b8f6404f723af4633c05ed4f96fb30b7b8.
   The gtcrn-aec crates port the LocalVQE inference code (ggml/gtcrn.cpp and
   ggml/daf_frontend.cpp) to Rust.
   Architecture: GTCRN, Xiaobin Rong et al., ICASSP 2024,
   https://github.com/Xiaobin-Rong/gtcrn (MIT).

4. Silero VAD v6.2.3 (16 kHz model)
